    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulforge is a dark and atmospheric dungeon crawler, with Souls-like combat with immersive, narrative-driven exploration. Dive into forgotten ruins, wield a powerful yet dangerously corrupted blade, and uncover the forgotten secrets that shattered an ancient kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>MASTER THE SOULFORGE</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a descendant tasked with reclaiming the scattered shards of the legendary Soulforge, a weapon that binds souls to steel. Balance devastating combat abilities with the constant threat of corruption, risking your very sanity with each powerful strike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/bb714b6c8707beef98a5fca0600a5ab2.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/bb714b6c8707beef98a5fca0600a5ab2.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/bb714b6c8707beef98a5fca0600a5ab2.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNRAVEL ANCIENT PUZZLES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into carefully designed puzzles and cryptic mysteries hidden within the ruins. Solve intricate riddles, activate ancient mechanisms, and unlock secret chambers to reveal powerful relics and forgotten truths. Each puzzle solved brings you closer to the heart of the kingdom's tragedy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/1e9b22f6eeb99f305bb0cf72a95d00e5.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/1e9b22f6eeb99f305bb0cf72a95d00e5.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/1e9b22f6eeb99f305bb0cf72a95d00e5.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NAVIGATE DEADLY DUNGEONS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-crafted dungeons teeming with cunning traps, ruthless enemies, and hidden pathways.  Every corner holds a new threat and a new discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/fa12af3e8d9ca06a2862c21e2524cae6.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/fa12af3e8d9ca06a2862c21e2524cae6.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/fa12af3e8d9ca06a2862c21e2524cae6.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEEK SANCTUARY IN HIDDEN HAVENS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secret rooms and hidden sanctuaries scattered throughout your journey, from cozy fireplaces offering a brief rest, to chambers housing the mystical Tree of Life. Purify your character from accumulating corruption, regain your strength, and reflect upon the path ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/63ac686c61663d0d5181e67e871bbe97.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/63ac686c61663d0d5181e67e871bbe97.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/63ac686c61663d0d5181e67e871bbe97.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE BONDS WITH FORGOTTEN SOULS\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with vividly voiced characters, including restless spirits, cunning allies, and a sardonic, sentient sword eager to mock your every misstep. Deepen these relationships to reveal hidden lore and secrets that will guide your journey\u2014or hasten your descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/d9ecfd6c991c80358e3cd535b922ae3b.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/d9ecfd6c991c80358e3cd535b922ae3b.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/d9ecfd6c991c80358e3cd535b922ae3b.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS POWER, ENDLESS MADNESS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades and customizable character builds ensure every attempt brings fresh challenges and new strategies. Face increasingly formidable foes, each encounter testing your skill, resolve, and grip on reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/f7c64701963afda148bbefcd29e5c724.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/f7c64701963afda148bbefcd29e5c724.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/f7c64701963afda148bbefcd29e5c724.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE, DARKLY BEAUTIFUL WORLD</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hauntingly atmospheric environments, hand-crafted visuals, and a soundtracks, Soulforge invites you to lose yourself in a dark fantasy world between haunting beauty and creeping madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulforge is a dark and atmospheric dungeon crawler, with Souls-like combat with immersive, narrative-driven exploration. Dive into forgotten ruins, wield a powerful yet dangerously corrupted blade, and uncover the forgotten secrets that shattered an ancient kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>MASTER THE SOULFORGE</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a descendant tasked with reclaiming the scattered shards of the legendary Soulforge, a weapon that binds souls to steel. Balance devastating combat abilities with the constant threat of corruption, risking your very sanity with each powerful strike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/bb714b6c8707beef98a5fca0600a5ab2.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/bb714b6c8707beef98a5fca0600a5ab2.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/bb714b6c8707beef98a5fca0600a5ab2.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNRAVEL ANCIENT PUZZLES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into carefully designed puzzles and cryptic mysteries hidden within the ruins. Solve intricate riddles, activate ancient mechanisms, and unlock secret chambers to reveal powerful relics and forgotten truths. Each puzzle solved brings you closer to the heart of the kingdom's tragedy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/1e9b22f6eeb99f305bb0cf72a95d00e5.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/1e9b22f6eeb99f305bb0cf72a95d00e5.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/1e9b22f6eeb99f305bb0cf72a95d00e5.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NAVIGATE DEADLY DUNGEONS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-crafted dungeons teeming with cunning traps, ruthless enemies, and hidden pathways.  Every corner holds a new threat and a new discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/fa12af3e8d9ca06a2862c21e2524cae6.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/fa12af3e8d9ca06a2862c21e2524cae6.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/fa12af3e8d9ca06a2862c21e2524cae6.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEEK SANCTUARY IN HIDDEN HAVENS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secret rooms and hidden sanctuaries scattered throughout your journey, from cozy fireplaces offering a brief rest, to chambers housing the mystical Tree of Life. Purify your character from accumulating corruption, regain your strength, and reflect upon the path ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/63ac686c61663d0d5181e67e871bbe97.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/63ac686c61663d0d5181e67e871bbe97.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/63ac686c61663d0d5181e67e871bbe97.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE BONDS WITH FORGOTTEN SOULS\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with vividly voiced characters, including restless spirits, cunning allies, and a sardonic, sentient sword eager to mock your every misstep. Deepen these relationships to reveal hidden lore and secrets that will guide your journey\u2014or hasten your descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/d9ecfd6c991c80358e3cd535b922ae3b.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/d9ecfd6c991c80358e3cd535b922ae3b.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/d9ecfd6c991c80358e3cd535b922ae3b.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS POWER, ENDLESS MADNESS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades and customizable character builds ensure every attempt brings fresh challenges and new strategies. Face increasingly formidable foes, each encounter testing your skill, resolve, and grip on reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/f7c64701963afda148bbefcd29e5c724.poster.avif?t=1755314099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/f7c64701963afda148bbefcd29e5c724.webm?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595940/extras/f7c64701963afda148bbefcd29e5c724.mp4?t=1755314099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE, DARKLY BEAUTIFUL WORLD</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hauntingly atmospheric environments, hand-crafted visuals, and a soundtracks, Soulforge invites you to lose yourself in a dark fantasy world between haunting beauty and creeping madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
